            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuciindi eco Berodaki Baladani mwana wa-Baladani mwami waBabuloni wakatumina Hezekiya magwalo acipo, nkaambo wakamvwa makani aakwe mbwaakacisidwe ambwaakapona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.32.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Mak 32:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Hezekiya wakatambula batumwa cakukondwa, wabatondezya iŋanda yazilondwedo zyakwe ansiliva angolida azisyu amafuta mabotu aŋanda yazilwisyo zyakwe azintu zyoonse izyakajanwa muzilondwedo zyakwe. Katakwe cintu niciba cimwi muŋanda yakwe nimuba mubwami bwakwe boonse Hezekiya ncaatakabatondezya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Isaya musinsimi wakasika kumwami Hezekiya, wamubuzya kuti, Aba bantu bakaambanzi? Bazwa kuli? Lino Hezekiya wakavuwa kuti, Bazwa kucisi cili kule, ku-Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino wakabuzya kuti, Ino ncinzi ncibabona muŋanda yako? Hezekiya wakavuwa kuti, Zintu zyoonse zili muŋanda yangu bazibona. Taakwe cintu niciba cimwi muzilondwedo zyangu ncindatabatondezya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Isaya wakaambila Hezekiya kuti, Swiilila ijwi lya-Jehova wamakamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
