              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Am 5:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzibe kuti mazuba aleza, zintu zyoonse zili muŋanda yako azintu zyoonse bamauso nzibakalondola mane kusikila kubuzuba obuno niziyootolwa ku-Babuloni, Takukooyoosyaala cintu niciba cimwi, mbwaamba Jehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
